{"summary":"Sort the colour threads, merge on the bobbin, complete the knitting! Cozy Game!","description":"A challenging yet entertaining world welcomes knitting enthusiasts in the Bobbin Sort: Knit Color Puzzle game, where you can unwind, relax and let your creativity flow. Get ready to immerse yourself in the colorful world of knitting!\nTrain your brain with this fun and relaxing color sorting puzzle game. It's a funny way to spend your free time, whether you're snuggled up at home or on the go. With its simple yet captivating gameplay, you'll find yourself getting hooked in no time!\nEmbark on a journey of colorful threads and spools as you tackle each level with skill and precision. Complete the braids by tying the colored threads to different spools and watch as you masterfully sort them into the corresponding spools. With each level, the challenge intensifies, testing your combinational logic and critical thinking skills.\nImmerse yourself in the soothing ambiance of \"Bobbin Sort: Knit Color Puzzle\" as you unravel its intricate puzzles. Whether you're a seasoned puzzler or a beginner, this game offers something for everyone. Plus, with its non-timed gameplay, you can enjoy the experience at your own pace.\nGet ready to switch, and amaze yourself with every move! With its seamless blend of knitting and puzzle-solving, this game is sure to become your new favorite pastime. So grab your yarn, rope and thread, and get ready to embark on the new colorful knitting adventure!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $119.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vtht_aoOs5o?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ugqL8B1up6MjJT_W13hjhpSlfpk45K1D7AsJyAR_NZ8woDq6e24TLrD-32G_VtTatsq9is-1qhr16YmqsIyo4w","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1CBJFJkOBLoIReM9gBq-povfdNrOLQH5lKRWJpqoHZ-x7pbrOUkSwGHqAhABwz6IZHz2KooqLexxywhHEwFb","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/C7_jQszyww-mO2SyM1